        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tony Richardson, Giorgio Ferroni, Peter Strauss\n- Roles: film director, producer, theatre director, film editor, screenwriter, actor\n- Works: Penalty Phase\n- Topics: film and television\n\nFacts:\n- Giorgio Ferroni was born on April 12, 1908, and was an Italian film director, film editor, and screenwriter.\n- Giorgio Ferroni was sometimes credited as Calvin Jackson Padget or Calvin J. Padget.\n- Tony Richardson was born on 5 June 1928 and was an English theatre and film director and producer whose career spanned five decades.\n- Penalty Phase is a 1986 American television thriller-drama film directed by Tony Richardson and starring Peter Strauss.\n- Giorgio Ferroni died on August 17, 1981.\n- Tony Richardson died on 14 November 1991.",
